  "description": "大切なパートナーとの旅行、せっかくなら心から寛げる特別な空間で過ごしたいですよね。今回は、おこもり滞在が叶う露天風呂付き客室や、記念日のお祝いにぴったりの極上宿を全国から厳選しました。二人だけの至福のひとときをお楽しみください。",
  "is_special_feature": true,
  "review": "<div class=\"space-y-12\">\n  <!-- 導入セクション -->\n  <section class=\"mb-10 text-center\">\n    \n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-950/10\" />\n\n<h2 id=\"ranking\">💑 おすすめ厳選宿・リゾート一覧</h2>\n<p>口コミ評価が高く、安心して宿泊できる人気の厳選施設をピックアップしました！</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500/10 via-pink-500/10 to-red-500/10 border border-rose-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-rose-900 bg-rose-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">💑 おすすめ 第1位</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-800\">⭐ 4.85 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/178404/178404.jpg\" alt=\"ルーシーキキ　伊豆高原　ウェルカムベビー　ファミリー　全室露天風呂付き客室の宿\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-rose-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-rose-950\">ルーシーキキ　伊豆高原　ウェルカムベビー　ファミリー　全室露天風呂付き客室の宿</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        【伊豆高原】全室露天風呂付き客室＆お部屋食でプライベート感抜群。カップルの特別な記念日・誕生日に圧倒的な人気を誇る大人リゾート。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F178404%2F178404.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-600 to-red-600 hover:from-rose-500 hover:to-red-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      💑 ルーシーキキ　伊豆高原　ウェルカムベビー　ファミリー　全室露天風呂付き客室の宿のプラン・空室を見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500/10 via-pink-500/10 to-red-500/10 border border-rose-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-rose-900 bg-rose-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">💑 おすすめ 第2位</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-800\">⭐ 4.90 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/187968/187968.jpg\" alt=\"別所温泉緑屋\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-rose-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-rose-950\">別所温泉緑屋</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        【長野・別所温泉】世界的なガーデンデザイナープロデュースの美しい庭園。源泉かけ流しの温泉と絶品のお部屋食で心洗われるロマンチック滞在。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F187968%2F187968.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-600 to-red-600 hover:from-rose-500 hover:to-red-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      💑 別所温泉緑屋のプラン・空室を見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500/10 via-pink-500/10 to-red-500/10 border border-rose-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-rose-900 bg-rose-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">💑 おすすめ 第3位</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-800\">⭐ 4.27 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/19529/19529.jpg\" alt=\"姫路ゆめさき川温泉　里湯ひととき　夢乃井\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-rose-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-rose-950\">姫路ゆめさき川温泉　里湯ひととき　夢乃井</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        【兵庫・姫路】豊かな自然と自家源泉の露天風呂。プライベート感満点の客室露天風呂付きプランで二人だけの特別な温泉旅を。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F19529%2F19529.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-600 to-red-600 hover:from-rose-500 hover:to-red-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      💑 姫路ゆめさき川温泉　里湯ひととき　夢乃井のプラン・空室を見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500/10 via-pink-500/10 to-red-500/10 border border-rose-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-rose-900 bg-rose-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">💑 おすすめ 第4位</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-800\">⭐ 4.22 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/20623/20623.jpg\" alt=\"会津芦ノ牧温泉　丸峰観光ホテル\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-rose-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-rose-950\">会津芦ノ牧温泉　丸峰観光ホテル</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        【福島・芦ノ牧温泉】渓谷美を一望する露天風呂付き客室が自慢。四季折々の絶景と伝統の極上和食会席で素敵なひととき。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"ht